  "result": "I fixed all three digest problems. `tsc` reported no errors and the tests under `tests/jobs` and `tests/services/notification-service.test.ts` passed. I removed the unused `asc` import after that run and didn't re-run anything. I also didn't add tests for the three cases.\n\n1. **Opt-in:** `listDigestSubscribers` in `notification-preference-repository.ts` now only returns users with at least one `digestOnly` preference in the workspace. Before, it returned anyone with any preference row.\n2. **Most recent updates:** `listUnreadSince` in `notification-repository.ts` now sorts newest first. The 50-entry cap in `buildDigest` therefore keeps the most recent updates, and the email headline is the newest one. `listUnreadSince` is only called from `buildDigest`, so nothing else changes order.\n3. **Archived workspaces:** `shouldRunForOrg` in `digest-email-job.ts` returns false for an archived workspace, and `buildDigest` in `digest-service.ts` returns `null` for one. Live workspaces are unaffected.",
